<view class="page--plain"><app-header title="{{step === 1 ? '先认识你' : '选择想比较的方向'}}" eyebrow="快速设置 · {{step}}/2"/><view wx:if="{{step === 1}}" class="animate-in"><view class="card"><text class="title">资料用于生成更贴近你的路径。</text><text class="body muted intro">这些字段来自你的账户资料，之后可以随时修改。</text><text class="label">希望怎么称呼你</text><input class="field" data-key="nickname" value="{{form.nickname}}" bindinput="input"/><text class="label">当前专业 *</text><input class="field" data-key="major" value="{{form.major}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="grid"><view><text class="label">年级 *</text><input class="field" data-key="grade" value="{{form.grade}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view><text class="label">入学年份</text><input class="field" type="number" data-key="enroll_year" value="{{form.enroll_year}}" bindinput="input"/></view></view></view><button class="button button--primary next" bindtap="next">继续</button></view><view wx:else class="animate-in"><text class="body muted choice-copy">选择 2–3 条路径即可立即开始对比；也可以暂时跳过。</text><path-coordinate-map paths="{{paths}}" selected="{{selected}}" max="3" bind:toggle="togglePath"/><button class="button button--primary next" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="finish">{{selected.length >= 2 ? '保存并开始探索' : '保存并进入今天'}}</button><button class="button button--secondary import" bindtap="importData">先导入课表或考试</button></view></view>
